             "Updating everything and applying it to your apps."),
            ("Update system", "system-software-update-symbolic",
             "Get the newest versions and apply them to the system, which "
             "includes your apps when the config says so.  Asks for your "
             "password; kernel and driver changes need a reboot.",
             ["bump", "all", "--system", "--home"],
             "Updating everything and applying it to the system."),
            ("Apply apps", "emblem-ok-symbolic",
             "Install what the config file says now in your apps (home), "
             "without updating anything (after editing the file by hand).",
             ["bump", "--home"],
             "Applying the config file to your apps."),
            ("Apply system", "computer-symbolic",
             "Apply the config file to the system as it is now, without "
             "updating anything.  Asks for your password.",
